                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/2931: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-01-20T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 20,
                                1919, 7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your January 11, 3 p.m. and January 17, 1 p.m. Your action is approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
